    <sec>
      <title>Introduction</title>
      <p>This article demonstrates various reference types using structured element-citation. References include <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="ref1">journal articles</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="ref2">books</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="ref3">book chapters</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="ref4">conference proceedings</xref>, and <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="ref5">web resources</xref>.</p>
    </sec>
